───────
  20 scanned · 15 in both · 5 only here
  keep 7 · redundant 4 · needs rebase 2 · unknown 7
  Verdicts count every package scanned; 5 of 20 have no row above.

  3 of the 15 packages compared were found to have no ::gentoo counterpart — those are the overlay's
